<title>MEXICO: Mexico May department store sales rise 8.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico May department store sales rise 8.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's department store sales for May rose 8.0 percent compared with the same month a year ago, the National Association of Supermarket and Department Stores said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Supermarket sales rose 3.3 percent over the same period, it added.</p>
</text>
